                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "873811e8-d3ed-394c-b655-dfda375758cd",
                        "entry_id": "63c9aaca-9dc6-321c-af31-602f5eea7411",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est tombé dans l’infortune."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d139ad92-6277-4337-9424-26d77d163a33",
                                "sense_id": "873811e8-d3ed-394c-b655-dfda375758cd",
                                "text": "Prince infortuné. — Reine infortunée."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c285ba6d-11bb-4d04-b49c-9fe7f0d85afb",
                                "sense_id": "873811e8-d3ed-394c-b655-dfda375758cd",
                                "text": "Les jours se passaient ainsi, […] tristes et cruels pour l’infortuné Torchonnet que son maître maltraitait sans relâche."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d190a449-f7d2-409a-b08c-9d5bd5ba319a",
                                "sense_id": "873811e8-d3ed-394c-b655-dfda375758cd",
                                "text": "— De même les infortunés chrononautes de Temps mort (G. Langelaan) vieillissent en quelques minutes de plusieurs dizaines d'années : tel est le risque d’accident temporel qui attend les pionniers de l'espace-temps."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e81ab0a7-12a7-4ef4-bf9b-48abccba84a4",
                        "source_entry_id": "63c9aaca-9dc6-321c-af31-602f5eea7411",
                        "source_sense_id": "873811e8-d3ed-394c-b655-dfda375758cd",
                        "target_lang_word": "ill-fated",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ill-fated",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                        "entry_id": "4159365e-effe-358b-be93-7a83c60a7c72",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "unlucky; doomed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1d7cb49-d1e6-4489-8434-e979ad5ccacb",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "My grandfather was originally scheduled to travel on the ill-fated last voyage of the RMS Lusitania, but thankfully had to change his plans at the last minute."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b76a3878-27f9-4c3d-bc2b-bb2a86080e12",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "The engine of the ill-fated mail was Stephenson, one of Whale's 4-6-0 \"Experiment\" class, which fact led to sensational outcryings in the daily papers about the scandal of \"experimental machines\" being used on fast trains!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fbebe8e-9b83-462c-a970-0fb550ba5737",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "In February 1927, eight short months before minstrel Al Jolson sang “My Mammy” to enthralled moviegoers who had never before heard pictures talk, the ill-fated silent movie industry had itself one last fling: Paramount Pictures' romantic comedy It, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f39ecff-2134-4961-b22d-d466801d486f",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "Despite his ill-fated spell at Anfield, he received a warm reception from the same Liverpool fans he struggled to win over before being sacked midway through last season."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adb09e41-808b-4ce7-9ced-4cc0c298ffb4",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "With Christie's words about \"all-talk-no-action\" in mind, notice that Obama and his two secretaries of state, Hillary Clinton and John Kerry, as well as his vice president, Joe Biden, were all senators, the last two serving for two or three decades, respectively. Not forgetting the ill-fated secretary of defense, Senator Chuck Hagel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "838c5fc7-7e6b-4140-a1fa-29bd4fbe160f",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "Yingluck is facing a possible 10-year prison term on charges of negligence linked to an ill-fated rice subsidy programme that cost the state billions of dollars."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3f7203c-7aa5-4cf2-a434-5df984fc3bc1",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "There is a broad-gauge transfer shed, lengths of running track with reconstructed stations, and a bit of Brunel's ill-fated atmospheric railway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "746ab1e4-be4b-4ca1-8665-22580be03dae",
                        "source_entry_id": "63c9aaca-9dc6-321c-af31-602f5eea7411",
                        "source_sense_id": "873811e8-d3ed-394c-b655-dfda375758cd",
                        "target_lang_word": "unfortunate",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unfortunate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8674f4fe-ed30-3247-a612-df93cd21dbac",
                                        "entry_id": "7a0ba233-ff90-314a-941d-33e5eefbae82",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not favored by fortune."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6e224f8-08ac-3da3-a651-01fe294a3fba",
                                        "entry_id": "7a0ba233-ff90-314a-941d-33e5eefbae82",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marked or accompanied by or resulting in misfortune."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac9ce6f9-65ad-42d0-884a-9a7066de3a70",
                                                "sense_id": "a6e224f8-08ac-3da3-a651-01fe294a3fba",
                                                "text": "But as the tower and towee reached the cross-roads again, another car, negligently driven, came round the corner, hit the Morris, and severed the tow rope, sending the unfortunate car back again into the shop window[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77927803-01f7-3762-8a66-6cd4d427cf7d",
                                        "entry_id": "7a0ba233-ff90-314a-941d-33e5eefbae82",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Regrettable or unsuitable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unfortunate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b099a0e-c4d9-3771-8836-deadb6443561",
                                        "entry_id": "2161c6a2-67ac-3394-88dd-194dda077407",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An unlucky person; one who has fallen into bad circumstances."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e020bb2a-0a65-46ba-8ba9-eebc9ef3eee8",
                                                "sense_id": "0b099a0e-c4d9-3771-8836-deadb6443561",
                                                "text": "Of those adults who used the trains every day, about half now travel daily by bus, [...] one unfortunate is reported to be walking to and from his employment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83053973-7e8b-4c4c-8e9a-fa4e6a79f7ae",
                                                "sense_id": "0b099a0e-c4d9-3771-8836-deadb6443561",
                                                "text": "Unlike the unfortunates aboard the Triumph, we viewers are in and out of the situation in under an hour and feel like we have had quite a lot of fun in the process."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6bc52b93-52dc-39a2-bf8f-25c695ca2b92",
                                        "entry_id": "2161c6a2-67ac-3394-88dd-194dda077407",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A prostitute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "euphemistic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
